  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flexible support to strengthen human rights, peacebuilding and civil society in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to strengthen the capacity of vulnerable individuals and collectives to defend their human rights, and the long-term impact of the program is to increase the participation and capacity of civil society organizations to protect and defend human rights and strengthen their participation in peacebuilding and the implementation of the peace agreement in Colombia. 

The intended target group are diverse, mainly small and medium-sized, Colombian civil society organizations and communities, human and environmental defenders working on the front lines of human rights defense.</narrative>
  </description>
